# INT-SOURCE: ../functional/142_template_rekey.my
# INT-ENGINES: tw default nj noopt
#
# INT unit (#78): a template call whose argument widens after it was
# redirected to an instance moves to the instance for its new key. The
# functional program runs as a coverage unit too, under the engines
# above, with no second copy (INT-SOURCE). It owns the re-key in
# instantiate_round, the setting aside of an instance no live code
# reaches (mark_orphan_instances) and its retirement from the tree,
# which no other unit reaches.
